cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TraceLit in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "TraceLit (有迹): auditable literature screening for undergraduate research"
abstract: >-
  TraceLit searches OpenAlex, verifies DOIs through Crossref/DataCite, and emits
  an auditable exclusion table, reproduction record, GB/T 7714 references, and
  cost accounting. It is a research prototype, not a systematic-review tool.
authors:
  - name: "TraceLit contributors"
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.5.0-beta.1
date-released: 2026-10-22
keywords:
  - literature screening
  - OpenAlex
  - DOI verification
  - reproducible research
  - GB/T 7714
